{"ID":"20240515131422-14vdkso","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131422-14vdkso","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131422-14vdkso\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515135931-l12iu67\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515135931-l12iu67\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:523,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515135931-l12iu67\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:779,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:779\u0026#125;","title":"048","type":"doc","updated":"20240515155921"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515135931-l12iu67","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1071px;","id":"20240515135931-l12iu67","updated":"20240515155921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2007/02/21"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"53歲，中等身材"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/05"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.初診乃因關節痛服類固醇9年，導致腎衰竭，等待腎臟移植，同時心臟有50﹪血管阻塞。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.本次就診乃因服西藥（sensipar 副甲狀腺藥物，師云：心臟有問題時甲狀腺也會有問題），造成隔日必嘔吐、噁心，人很焦慮，落髮重，睡不好，走路不平衡，足踝有舊傷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）無胸痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）雙足熱。（初診時雙足冰冷）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）關節腫已痊癒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）大便每日5-6次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）有尿意，但解之只有幾滴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）胃口不好，一直感覺噁心。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (7)無頭暈→腎衰竭患者會出現頭暈噁心，故詢問之"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（8）口渴，喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（9）睡前身熱，需吹電扇。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（10）運動無汗出。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈數有力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌體大，舌面多小空洞，舌中直裂紋中空。（心臟受損之象）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）瞳孔無反應、體積小、形狀略異常→腎陽已失。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）內眥扁而淡紅夾有黃白濁斑→心臟肥大、貧血且兼有痰飲。（正常內眥成圓形色鮮紅）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽已失，水泛中焦故嘔吐。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"旋覆花三錢 代赭石三錢 乾薑二錢 生薑二片 澤瀉五錢 桂枝五錢 半夏三錢 茯苓三錢 丹皮三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芍五錢牛膝三錢 川芎三錢 桃仁三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮成三碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每天早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.病患為中年白人婦女，因未能按時回診，又持續服用西藥，導致身體狀況越來越差。本日回診時精神略萎靡，說話低聲略無力，經常重複類似話語，自述不畏懼病痛但其實十分焦慮。師對本病患不愛性命之行為亦頗有微詞，同時認為病情相當棘手。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.病患腹大，主要是因為肺中水氣要進入腎中，但無法下降進入，堵在中焦所致。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.處方以旋覆花、代赭石降逆止嘔，利用金石類藥物重墜以鎮逆。乾薑溫中止嘔，生薑（配半夏）散水氣。澤瀉、半夏、茯苓利水。丹皮、白芍、牛膝、川芎、桃仁活血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.此人有心血管疾病為何仍用白芍？師曰：因此人足踝受傷過故欲用白芍活血化瘀，而此人無胸滿故可用白芍。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}